@startuml
title DMS - Use Case Laporan Kinerja

left to right direction

actor "Penanggung Jawab Kinerja" as PJK

rectangle "Laporan Kinerja Metadata" {
  usecase "Lihat Dashboard Kinerja" as UCDashboard
  usecase "Lihat Total Dokumen Final" as UCTotalDokumen
  usecase "Lihat Total Nominal Realisasi" as UCTotalNominal
  usecase "Lihat Distribusi Selesai / Tersimpan / Diarsipkan" as UCDistribusi
  usecase "Lihat Daftar Fungsi" as UCDaftarFungsi
  usecase "Lihat Detail Fungsi" as UCDetailFungsi
  usecase "Lihat Kegiatan dalam Fungsi" as UCKegiatan
  usecase "Lihat Dokumen Final per Kegiatan" as UCDokumenKegiatan
  usecase "Lihat Metadata Dokumen Final" as UCMetadataDokumen
}

PJK --> UCDashboard
PJK --> UCTotalDokumen
PJK --> UCTotalNominal
PJK --> UCDistribusi
PJK --> UCDaftarFungsi
PJK --> UCDetailFungsi
PJK --> UCKegiatan
PJK --> UCDokumenKegiatan
PJK --> UCMetadataDokumen

UCDashboard ..> UCTotalDokumen : <<include>>
UCDashboard ..> UCTotalNominal : <<include>>
UCDashboard ..> UCDistribusi : <<include>>
UCDaftarFungsi ..> UCDetailFungsi : <<include>>
UCDetailFungsi ..> UCKegiatan : <<include>>
UCKegiatan ..> UCDokumenKegiatan : <<include>>
UCDokumenKegiatan ..> UCMetadataDokumen : <<include>>

note bottom
  Laporan Kinerja hanya metadata.
  Tidak ada aksi preview, download, lampiran, atau file.
  Dashboard berfokus pada metrik dokumen, nominal, dan status.
end note

@enduml
